{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The famous duo appears! Their slightly funny, slapstick adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Radiant Rabbits&quot; is a village where rabbits and fairies live in peace. Ravi and Navi have to defeat the great demon king &quot;Shivarra&quot;, who is planning to destroy the village!<br>The main character, rabbit &quot;Ravi&quot;, joins forces with fairy &quot;Navi&quot; and sets out on an adventure to collect the &quot;Sacred Carrot&quot;, the source of happiness hidden by Shivarra.<br><br>On their way, they are greeted by a variety of tricks and unique characters.<br>They can compete in boat races with beaver, ride a minecart down a mining railroad, and even play retro arcade games!<br><br>As they progress through the story, they can take advantage of the increasing number of actions, use the coins they've collected to buy dress-up items in the souvenir shop, and more...<br>There's so much to do in Ravi world!<br><br>Let's go on a great adventure with Ravi 'n' Navi!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Carrot Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841250/b78365da1d657f4d75bbcfcf0ec6336042051d54.jpg"},{"name":"Carrot Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841250/73f1dad1c9c2a741c2f70cf3c1f631508e7fe5f5.jpg"},{"name":"Carrot Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841250/a47aa7bf0532c60914637e4057079f5ccebc34ce.jpg"},{"name":"A Rare Secret","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841250/1583dc7caa9d22fbf93d36ea8484350ab20faca3.jpg"},{"name":"A Penchant for Plants?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841250/7a2481af961c821cafb055bb0d07424b25f7acfc.jpg"},{"name":"The Forbidden Fruit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity